    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2024-june/q2",
      "question": "<p>In this question you must show all stages of your working.</p><p>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x) = 2x^3 - 3ax^2 + bx + 8a\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> are constants.</p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(x - 4)\"></span> is a factor of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\"></span>,</p><p>(a) use the factor theorem to show that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"10a = 32 + b\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>Given also that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(x - 2)\"></span> is a factor of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\"></span>,</p><p>(b) express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\"></span> in the form</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x) = (2x + k)(x - 4)(x - 2)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is a constant to be found.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p><p>(c) Hence,</p><p>(i) state the number of real roots of the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x) = 0\"></span></p><p>(ii) write down the largest root of the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f\\left(\\frac{1}{3}x\\right) = 0\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
      "steps": [
