      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2024-june/q3",
      "question": "<p>Relative to a fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span>,</p><ul><li>point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> has position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"9\\mathbf{i} - 8\\mathbf{j}\"></span></li></ul><ul><li>point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span> has position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\mathbf{i} - 5\\mathbf{j}\"></span></li></ul><p>(a) Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{PQ}\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\"></span> is the point such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{QR} = 9\\mathbf{i} + 18\\mathbf{j}\"></span></p><p>(b) show that angle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"PQR = 90^\\circ\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>Given also that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"S\"></span> is the point such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{PS} = 3\\overrightarrow{QR}\"></span></p><p>(c) find the exact area of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"PQRS\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p>",
