      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2024-june/q9",
      "question": "<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p = \\log_a 16\"></span></p><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q = \\log_a 25\"></span></p><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> is a constant.</p><p>Find in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span> and/or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\"></span>,</p><p>(a) <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\log_a 256\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></p><p>(b) <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\log_a 100\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>(c) <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\log_a 80 \\times \\log_a 3.2\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
