      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2024-june/q11",
      "question": "<p>The prices of two precious metals are being monitored.</p><p>The price per gram of metal <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span>, £<span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"V_A\"></span>, is modelled by the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"V_A = 100 + 20e^{0.04t}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> is the number of months after monitoring began.</p><p>The price per gram of metal <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span>, £<span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"V_B\"></span>, is modelled by the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"V_B = pe^{-0.02t}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span> is a positive constant and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> is the number of months after monitoring began.</p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"V_B = 2V_A\"></span> when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t = 0\"></span></p><p>(a) find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t = T\"></span>, the rate of **increase** in the price per gram of metal <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> was equal to the rate of **decrease** in the price per gram of metal <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span></p><p>(b) Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\"></span>, giving your answer to one decimal place.</p><p>(Solutions based entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.)</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p>",
      "steps": [
