      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2024-june/q13",
      "question": "<p>In this question you must show all stages of your working.</p><p>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</p><p>(a) Show that the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sin \\theta (7 \\sin \\theta - 4 \\cos \\theta) = 4\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>can be written as</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3 \\tan^2 \\theta - 4 \\tan \\theta - 4 = 0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p><p>(b) Hence solve, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0 &lt; x &lt; 360^\\circ\"></span></p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sin x (7 \\sin x - 4 \\cos x) = 4\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>giving your answers to one decimal place.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p><p>(c) Hence find the smallest solution of the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sin 4\\alpha (7 \\sin 4\\alpha - 4 \\cos 4\\alpha) = 4\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>in the range <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"720^\\circ &lt; \\alpha &lt; 1080^\\circ\"></span>, giving your answer to one decimal place.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></p>",
